{"speciesId":551,"names":{"fr":"Mascaïman","es":"Sandile","en":"Sandile","ja":"メグロコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit dans le sable des déserts. Le sable chauffé par le soleil empêche son corps de refroidir."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They live buried in the sands of the desert. The sun-warmed sands prevent their body temperature from dropping."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se déplace dans le sable en gardant le nez et les yeux à découvert. La membrane noire protège ses yeux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It moves along below the sand’s surface, except for its nose and eyes. A dark membrane shields its eyes from the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They live hidden under hot desert sands in order to keep their body temperature from dropping."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They live hidden under hot desert sands in order to keep their body temperature from dropping."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se déplace dans le sable en gardant le nez et les yeux à découvert. La membrane noire protège ses yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se desplaza hundido en la arena, dejando al descubierto solo los ojos y la nariz. Una membrana negra le protege los ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It moves along below the sand’s surface, except for its nose and eyes. A dark membrane shields its eyes from the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"砂の 中に 潜り 目と 鼻を 外に 出して 移動する。 黒い 膜が 目を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit dans le sable des déserts. Le sable chauffé par le soleil empêche son corps de refroidir."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en las arenas desérticas, donde las altas temperaturas de las mismas evitan que su cuerpo se enfríe."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They live buried in the sands of the desert. The sun-warmed sands prevent their body temperature from dropping."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"砂漠の 砂の 中で 生活。 太陽に 暖められた 砂が 体温の 低下を 防ぐのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il se déplace dans le sable en gardant le nez et les yeux à découvert. La membrane noire protège ses yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se desplaza hundido en la arena, dejando al descubierto solo los ojos y la nariz. Una membrana negra le protege los ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It moves along below the sand’s surface, except for its nose and eyes. A dark membrane shields its eyes from the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"砂の 中に 潜り 目と 鼻を 外に 出して 移動する。 黒い 膜が 目を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il vit dans le sable des déserts. Le sable chauffé par le soleil empêche son corps de refroidir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vive en las arenas desérticas, donde las altas temperaturas de las mismas evitan que su cuerpo se enfríe."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"They live buried in the sands of the desert. The sun-warmed sands prevent their body temperature from dropping."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"砂漠の 砂の 中で 生活。 太陽に 暖められた 砂が 体温の 低下を 防ぐのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon avance tapi dans le sable, une manière pour lui de se cacher des prédateurs et de maintenir sa température corporelle."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se desplaza sumergido bajo la arena, como si nadase. Así se esconde de sus enemigos y evita que descienda su temperatura corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It submerges itself in sand and moves as if swimming. This wise behavior keeps its enemies from finding it and maintains its temperature."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"砂の中に 潜り 泳ぐように 移動。 敵に みつからないためと 体温を 下げない 知恵 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Tapi dans le sable, il attend qu’une proie passe pour lui croquer la patte. Il a notamment un gros faible pour les Kraknoix en guise d’apéritif."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se desplaza hundido en la arena y atrapa a las presas incautas de la superficie mordiéndoles la pata. Su manjar favorito son los Trapinch."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It conceals itself in the sand and chomps down on the legs of any prey that unwarily walk over it. Its favorite food is Trapinch."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"砂の中に 身を 潜め 上を 歩いた 獲物の 足を ガブリ。 大好物は ナックラー。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les températures tropicales d’Alola sont idéales pour ce Pokémon, que l’on peut même parfois rencontrer en dehors du désert."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El hábitat de Alola, cálido durante todo el año, es ideal para este Pokémon, por lo que también se le puede ver fuera del desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Alola, where it’s warm all year round, is a comfortable environment for this Pokémon. Sometimes you’ll even see it outside of deserts."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"年中 暖かい アローラは 過ごしやすい 環境。 砂漠 以外でも 時々 見かける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"N’étant pas très bon chasseur, il se nourrit de la charogne qu’il trouve dans les dunes, ce qui lui vaut son surnom de « nettoyeur du désert »."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se nutre principalmente de cadáveres hallados en la arena, debido a su ineptitud para la caza. De ahí su apodo: el Barrendero del Desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sandile’s still not good at hunting, so it mostly eats things that have collapsed in the desert. It’s called “the cleaner of the desert.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"まだ 狩りは 下手なので おもに 砂漠で 行き倒れたものを 食う。 砂漠の掃除屋と 呼ばれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se protège du froid qui sévit la nuit dans le désert en s’enfouissant profondément dans le sable, où il dort jusqu’au lever du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En las frías noches del desierto se oculta a mucha profundidad en la arena y duerme hasta que sale el sol."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The desert gets cold at night, so when the sun sets, this Pokémon burrows deep into the sand and sleeps until sunrise."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"砂漠の 夜は 冷えるので 砂の 奥深くに 潜り 陽が 出るまで 眠って 過ごす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Malgré son petit gabarit, il a beaucoup de force dans les pattes arrière. Il parcourt le désert comme s’il nageait dans le sable."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es pequeño, pero cuenta con un tren inferior fuerte. Se desplaza por el desierto abriéndose paso entre la arena, como si nadase."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Sandile is small, but its legs and lower body are powerful. Pushing sand aside as it goes, Sandile moves through the desert as if it’s swimming."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"小さいが 足腰の 力は 強い。 砂を かき分けて 砂漠を 泳ぐように 移動。"}],"varieties":[{"id":551,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",46],[14,"level-up",46],[15,"level-up",46],[16,"level-up",46],[17,"level-up",46],[18,"level-up",46],[20,"level-up",39],[25,"level-up",39]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4]